WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
I'll give you three minutes to say goodbye to your son.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,800
When it's over, I'll put him under Longmu City

3
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:05,400
Bring someone here to collect the corpse

4
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,600
I'm waiting for you

5
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,600
This guy is a real tiger

6
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,200
Just kill Xiaosong

7
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,040
He also wanted to provoke Jianzhu for personal gain

8
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:14,040
I guessed the sword pillar

9
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:16,640
I wish I could strangle Chen Haoyun through the screen

10
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:18,780
Komatsu died

11
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:21,580
The sword pillar will kiss Longmu City in at most two days.

12
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:26,220
I am fighting with Xia Guoxiu

13
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:27,420
You call Fang Lie

14
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:32,930
Let him order Chen Haoyun to let me go if you die

15
00:00:32,930 --> 00:00:34,130
I will take revenge on you

16
00:00:34,130 --> 00:00:36,130
But you are not allowed to disgrace Dajian Island

17
00:00:39,990 --> 00:00:41,190
Do you think Chen Haoyun dares to kill you?

18
00:00:41,190 --> 00:00:42,390
Doesn’t Xia Guo know?

19
00:00:42,390 --> 00:00:44,390
They just want to use violence to scare Jianzhu

20
00:00:44,390 --> 00:00:45,590
Force us to retreat

21
00:00:45,590 --> 00:00:47,190
I am your father

22
00:00:47,190 --> 00:00:48,990
He is also the leader of Jianzhu

23
00:00:48,990 --> 00:00:50,190
I want to seek for the sword pillar
